@startuml
title Login and current-user lookup

actor User
participant "frontend" as Frontend
participant "nginx-gateway" as Gateway
participant "auth-service" as Auth
database "auth-postgres" as AuthDb

User -> Frontend : Submit email/password
Frontend -> Gateway : POST /api/auth/auth/login
Gateway -> Auth : POST /auth/login
Auth -> AuthDb : Load user by normalized email
Auth -> Auth : Verify password hash and active flag
Auth -> AuthDb : Persist hashed refresh token
Auth --> Gateway : JWT access token, refresh token, user claims
Gateway --> Frontend : Auth response
Frontend -> Frontend : Store local session

User -> Frontend : Open profile/current session
Frontend -> Gateway : GET /api/auth/auth/me\nAuthorization: Bearer token
Gateway -> Auth : GET /auth/me
Auth -> Auth : Validate JWT and role/provider claims
Auth --> Gateway : Current user
Gateway --> Frontend : Current user

@enduml
